+Ready: the note in `answer` (markdown) + `actions[]` `{type: "OPEN_URL", label, url: "/api/v1/fos/handoff-note?...
+&format=pdf"}` (call it with the same Bearer token). Not ready: the refusal with X / Y and the next fix.
